From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:12:17 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 030/207] server: hold strict tools to their schema under
 tool_choice auto

Under tool_choice auto (or none given) with a tool marked "strict": true, compile an xgrammar triggered_tags grammar: free text, and at the template's call opener a call tag whose strict tools' arguments follow their schema while other tools take any JSON object. TENSORFOLD_TOOL_GRAMMAR=1 (legacy TF_DSV41_TOOL_GRAMMAR) holds every auto tools request. LFM2 and engines without a grammar library stay unconstrained; required and named calls are unchanged.
---
